      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper discusses certain problems involved in communication between physician, cancer patient and society. The authors suggest that information given to a cancer patient on his or her diagnosis should be determined by the patient's willingness to know and prognosis. Also, suggestions on improvement of treatment of cancer patients of clinical group 4 are made."},
